    "interface_contract": "spawn.render(name, **kw) -> str: raises ValueError('unfilled_placeholder: <name>') only for a template token missing from kw; single-pass substitution. daemon.hold_render_error(task_id, exc) -> None: status held, hold_reason 'render_error: <msg[:200]>', pipeline.render_error, pipeline.dispatched_at removed, notify.notify once. spawn.run_worker returns {'status': 'held', 'reason': 'render_error'} on a render failure before any claim. Hold reasons starting with 'render_error' are never auto-fixed."
